|qt..............sq
|.qt............sq.
|.qs............rq.

view U key rest origin 1 -7
|q................q
|qt..............sq
|.qt............sq.
|.qs............rq.

view R key rest origin -4 -6
|q...
|qt..
|.qts
|.qts
|..sr
|..qr

view L key rest origin -8 -6
|...q
|..tq
|tsq.
|tsq.
